license: MIT
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
abstract: >-
  Collector of closed pull requests and their review history from public
  GitHub repositories (GraphQL API), with per-PR feature computation and a
  manifest of a 40-repository corpus, the submission-time models and later
  analyses of the HAIT 2026, ІКТ 2026 and ІТІА 2026 papers, and the reviewer
  ranking experiments of the AAIT 2026 paper. Built for a PhD dissertation on
  the efficiency of the code review process.
keywords:
  - code review
  - pull requests
  - GitHub
  - mining software repositories
  - reviewer recommendation
